From 633d6f115c778ef5ff02507b603f5b35f10e1248 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coop-fetch <coop-fetch@localhost>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:34:58 -0900
Subject: [PATCH] Co-op menu tabs: the module's tabs lead the menu's strip

The Multiplayer tab of oot-remake-multiplayer's module (its docs/hookshot.md
"The Multiplayer tab"), and any tab after it (Mods), in the Insert menu.
gpu/vk/hos_coop_menu.h is the table: the module names its tabs
(hos_coop_menu_tabs, hos_coop_menu_tab_name), gives a tab's rows, selection,
help box and prompts (hos_coop_menu_page) and takes the presses on it
(hos_coop_menu_input); hos_coop_menu_wanted, optional, opens the menu on a
tab or closes it. vk_coop.cpp finds the five exports once the bridge has
loaded the module, as it finds the draw exports. vk_menu.cpp shows the
module's tabs first in the strip (the menu opens on the first one until the
player picks another), draws a module tab's rows with the menu's own cells
and help box (draw_coop_page), and hands the arrows, confirm, back, the
cursor and the clicks to the module (coop_tick); back with nothing left on
the module's side closes the menu, as Esc does. A module without the
exports: no tabs, the menu as before.
---
